        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   Our commmunications have been restored, and I've contact O.P.D. They'll be joining up with us shortly!",
        "type": "dialog",
