    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   I still can't get in touch with the recon team!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "I still can't get in touch with the recon team!"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  ... Who exactly are you?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "... Who exactly are you?"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\",fadetime=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw.png",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[Delay(time=1)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  I don't expect you to know who I am...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "I don't expect you to know who I am..."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  But, I know that person next to you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "But, I know that person next to you."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Is Reunion... going to continue fighting us?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Is Reunion... going to continue fighting us?"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\", name2=\"char_1504_cqbw\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  Hey, hey, don't be like that.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "Hey, hey, don't be like that."
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  I have no love for that she-dragon, Talulah. I'm not even cut out for this goaltending business. It's a pain to have to rush over here after a long day of work.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "I have no love for that she-dragon, Talulah. I'm not even cut out for this goaltending business. It's a pain to have to rush over here after a long day of work."
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  So for the sake of future cooperation, why don't we exchange some pleasantries first?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "So for the sake of future cooperation, why don't we exchange some pleasantries first?"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  You may simply call me... W.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "You may simply call me... W."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  I've waited a long time to see that person next to you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "I've waited a long time to see that person next to you."
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  ...Doctor?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "...Doctor?"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\", name2=\"char_1504_cqbw\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  Dr.{@Nickname}......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Dr.{@Nickname}......"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  I have a few little questions I'd like to ask {@Nickname}. Would you be so kind as to give us some... alone time?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "I have a few little questions I'd like to ask {@Nickname}. Would you be so kind as to give us some... alone time?"
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[stopmusic(fadetime=1)]",
        "type": "stop_music",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]  You're wasting your breath.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "You're wasting your breath."
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#8\", name2=\"char_1504_cqbw\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#8.png",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  --Don't be so hasty. I have some information you might be interested in.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "--Don't be so hasty. I have some information you might be interested in."
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  Actually, we just met some rather slick fellows... Quite skilled, and dressed just like you guys.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Actually, we just met some rather slick fellows... Quite skilled, and dressed just like you guys."
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  Though their camouflage might have been enough to fool Ursus, I saw right through their little trick~",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Though their camouflage might have been enough to fool Ursus, I saw right through their little trick~"
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#2\", name2=\"char_1504_cqbw\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2.png",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Could they be from the recon team?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Could they be from the recon team?"
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  I'm glad... that they're safe...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I'm glad... that they're safe..."
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#2\", name2=\"char_1504_cqbw\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2.png",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  Little bunny, are you their leader?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Little bunny, are you their leader?"
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  ? !",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "? !"
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#1\", name2=\"char_1504_cqbw\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1.png",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  I'm quite curious, what charm do you hold over them... so that they'd give their lives so enthusiastically and unremorsefully for you?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "I'm quite curious, what charm do you hold over them... so that they'd give their lives so enthusiastically and unremorsefully for you?"
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\", name2=\"char_1504_cqbw\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  What... are you saying...?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "What... are you saying...?"
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  You heard me. None of them... will be returning to you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "You heard me. None of them... will be returning to you."
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  Hey, you...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Hey, you..."
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  Are you really... worth sacrificing their lives over?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Are you really... worth sacrificing their lives over?"
    },
